[agent] **How it ran (all platform-side):** Since the SDK connects in *python* (external) engine mode, no compute happens locally there. I instead:
[agent] 1. Uploaded both CSVs to HopsFS via the dataset API.
[agent] 2. Wrote a **PySpark feature pipeline** (`submission/feature_pipeline.py`) and ran it as a Hopsworks **PYSPARK job** (`features48dc48-fp`, env `spark-feature-pipeline`) on the cluster — execution `SUCCEEDED`. All joins/transforms executed in Spark.
[agent] **Transform correctness (verified against the read-back):**
[agent] - `amount_usd = amount × fx_rate` — e.g. R00000 GBP 15.35 × 1.27 = 19.4945 ✓
